{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2022-07-21 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT ENABLES MICAS TO OBTAIN ONE OF THE FIRST O-RAN CERTIFICATIONS FOR OPEN RAN RADIO UNIT', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED THAT THE KEYSIGHT OPEN RADIO ACCESS NETWORK ARCHITECT (KORA) SOLUTIONS ENABLED MICAS TO OBTAIN ONE OF THE FIRST O-RAN CERTIFICATIONS FOR ITS 5G OPEN RAN RADIO UNIT (O-RU). THE O-RAN CONFORMANCE CERTIFICATION WAS ISSUED BY THE ASIA & PACIFIC OTIC IN PRC (APOP)'}